<div>
 <div class="page-actions"><button type="button" data-bank-link>Connect a bank</button></div>
 <section class="panel editor" data-show="bankReview" hidden>
  <div class="section-heading"><h2>Check possible duplicate accounts</h2><a data-close-bank-review href="/?view=accounts">Close</a></div>
  <p>No transactions will import until you complete this check. A match uses the bank, account type, and last four digits of an account connected by you or your partner.</p>
  <form data-op="bank:confirmAccounts" data-transform="bankReview"><div data-list="decisions"></div><template data-row="decisions"><label><span data-text="account"></span><select required><option value="">Is this an account already connected?</option><option value="same">Same account — keep the existing connection</option><option value="different">Different account — import this account</option></select></label></template><p>Other selected accounts will import with this connection.</p><button type="submit">Confirm accounts</button><p data-message role="alert"></p></form>
 </section>
 <section class="panel"><h2>Accounts in this budget</h2><div data-list="accounts"></div><p class="empty-state" data-show="noAccounts">No accounts yet. Connect a bank to import transactions automatically.</p>
  <template data-row="accounts"><div class="account-row"><div><strong data-text="name"></strong><small data-text="detail"></small></div><div class="account-controls" data-show="editable"><details><summary>Rename</summary><form data-op="accounts:rename"><label>Account name<input name="name" required maxlength="100"/></label><button type="submit">Save account name</button><p data-message role="alert"></p></form></details><details data-show="move"><summary>Move account</summary><p>Only transactions from today onward will be assigned to the destination budget. Earlier records stay in their current budget. Existing private history stays private. Earlier shared history remains available to both partners.</p><p><strong>Destination budget</strong><br/><span data-text="destination"></span></p><button type="button" class="secondary" data-op="accounts:move" data-confirm="Move this account from today onward? Earlier history stays in its original budget.">Confirm account move</button></details></div></div></template>
 </section>
 <section class="panel"><h2>Your bank connections</h2><div data-list="connections"></div><p data-show="noConnections">No bank connections yet.</p>
  <template data-row="connections"><div class="connection-row"><div><strong data-text="institution"></strong><small data-text="detail"></small><p class="over" data-text="error" data-show="error"></p></div><div class="button-row"><a class="button" data-review-link data-show="review">Review accounts</a><button type="button" class="secondary" data-op="bank:sync" data-kind="action" data-success="Sync requested. Check the connection status below.">Sync</button><button type="button" class="secondary" data-bank-link>Reconnect</button><button type="button" class="secondary" data-op="bank:disconnect" data-kind="action" data-confirm="Disconnect this bank? Imported history will be kept." data-success="Disconnected. History retained.">Disconnect</button></div></div></template>
 </section>
 <section class="panel narrow" data-show="sharing"><h2>Your shared budget</h2>
  <div class="banner" data-show="invite"><p>You have an invitation. Accept it with the email address that received the invitation.</p><button type="button" data-op="sharing:accept" data-kind="action">Accept invitation</button></div>
  <div data-show="createShared"><p>You can share one budget with one partner. Each of you has equal control. Your private budget remains separate.</p><button type="button" class="secondary" data-op="sharing:create" data-args="{}">Create shared budget</button></div>
  <div data-show="sharedDetails"><button type="button" class="danger" data-op="sharing:leave" data-show="leave" data-confirm="Leave this shared budget? Your accounts return to your private budget. The other partner keeps this budget. You keep read access to previously shared records.">Leave shared budget</button>
   <p data-text="members"></p><form data-op="sharing:invite" data-kind="action" data-success="Invitation queued for email delivery."><label>Partner’s email<input name="email" type="email" required/></label><button type="submit">Send invitation</button><p data-message role="alert"></p></form>
   <div data-list="invitations"></div><template data-row="invitations"><div class="alert-row"><span><span data-text="email"></span><small data-text="detail"></small></span><button type="button" class="secondary" data-op="sharing:revoke" data-show="revoke">Revoke</button></div></template>
  </div>
 </section>
 <div data-contributions></div>
</div>
